.temp/resources/TASK-260715-3o0co4/TASK-260715-3o0co4_results.md:3:Implemented the supervised public AF_UNIX/SOCK_DGRAM PacketFlowBridge, RunHandle, descriptor-borrow contract, production Darwin socket/readiness I/O, bounded forward/reverse framing pumps, run-scoped saturating metric schema, privacy-safe logging, first-error-wins termination, and ordered exactly-once cleanup. Darwin receive sizing uses public SO_NREAD for the first-packet byte count plus one consuming recvmsg for MSG_TRUNC.
