.temp/resources/TASK-260715-135rr8/TASK-260715-135rr8_review-verdict-rev4.md:43:The first independent full coverage run exited 1 because the pre-existing libssh2 `channelOperationPressureIsBounded` race observed `.cancelled` instead of `.resourceLimitExceeded`; the candidate does not touch that code. The same known LOGBOOK anomaly reproduced in 1 of 5 focused repeats. A fresh full coverage rerun passed all 494 tests. Both results are preserved; acceptance does not claim this unrelated existing flake was fixed by CR rev4.
