+| ADR-015 | Accepted | Select MTU 1500 for the macOS-first M0 baseline; keep 4096 injectable only after end-to-end path proof and reject 8500 as the default because the accepted constrained-buffer matrix produced `EMSGSIZE` sender refusals. The exact buffer, batching, HEV, session, memory, fork, and revalidation bindings are recorded in [`TASK-260715-2jatnd`](../docs/TASK-260715-2jatnd_m0-bridge-hev-decision-adr.md). |
